/P 194 0 R
/E (The establishment of these policies and working groups has helped to mitigate problems with sustainable development, environmental conversation, and preservation of marine ecosystems in the Arctic. However, delegates must come together to tackle the issues with climate, technological infrastructure, and demand for natural resources that we currently face.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
