<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (As interest in Arctic resources and infrastructure continues to grow, the international community faces an urgent need to establish cooperative mechanisms for investment, governance, and sustainable development of the Arctic region. A multilateral Arctic investment and development framework could)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
